      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/bon-air/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town incorporated in 1932, formalizing its status after decades of mill‑driven growth.",
